# Spec for tools/riscpkg.py: PThreadTicker.
Package: PThreadTicker
Section: System
Priority: Optional
Licence: Free
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Standards-Version: 0.4.0
Environment: arm
Homepage: https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-unixlib
Description: Keeps threaded UnixLib programs safe in the desktop
 The PThreadTicker module, from riscos-unixlib 5.0.3.3, installed in
 !System. It runs UnixLib's thread switcher only when it's safe to.
 Programs that need it load a copy from their own directory if this
 one isn't there; a newer one in !System wins.
Build-Map: PThreadTicker/!System -> System
Build-Notice: PThreadTicker, packaged for PackMan from the release zip on
 https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-unixlib/releases
 .
